# GoodPlays Core

## Product

Goodreads-for-games: library, ratings, import, research recommendations, social (phased). **Public by default.**

## Monorepo

```
GoodPlays.sln
src/GoodPlays.Api/            # ASP.NET Core 9, Hangfire, Clerk JWT
src/GoodPlays.Domain/         # Entities, enums
src/GoodPlays.Infrastructure/ # EF Core, migrations, external APIs
src/GoodPlays.Ml/             # Research reco + ML.NET (Phase 3)
apps/web/                     # React 19 + Vite SPA
tests/GoodPlays.Tests/        # xUnit
```

## Stack (locked)

- **Backend:** C# / .NET 9 — no Python
- **DB:** PostgreSQL (Neon) + EF Core
- **Jobs:** Hangfire + Redis (Upstash)
- **Auth:** Clerk
- **Metadata:** IGDB primary
- **Deploy:** Railway (API), GitHub Pages (web)

