## TDD default

New behavior → failing test first. See `csharp-tdd` and `typescript-tdd` rules.

## Commands

```bash
docker compose up -d
dotnet ef database update --project src/GoodPlays.Infrastructure --startup-project src/GoodPlays.Api
dotnet run --project src/GoodPlays.Api
cd apps/web && npm run dev
dotnet test && cd apps/web && npm test
```

## Do not

- Commit secrets (`.env` is gitignored)
- Scrape Metacritic — use OpenCritic/IGDB
- Call IGDB from the browser — use API gateway
